                <h4>Program Overview</h4>
            </div>

            <p>
                The Diploma in Medical Laboratory Technology (DMLT) is a 2-year paramedical diploma course designed to
                train
                students in laboratory diagnosis, testing procedures, and handling modern medical equipment.
            </p>

            <span>DMLT professionals play a crucial role in healthcare by:</span>

            <ul class="li-bullet">
                <li>Conducting blood, urine, and tissue tests </li>
                <li>Assisting doctors in disease diagnosis</li>
                <li>Operating advanced laboratory instruments</li>
                <li>Ensuring accurate and timely reports</li>
            </ul>

            <span>It is one of the fastest-growing healthcare careers with high demand in hospitals and diagnostic
                centers.
            </span>
        </div>
